---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const results = [
  ["Dependencies install successfully.", "Dependency installation completed in 1s."],
  [
    "The application starts and answers an HTTP request.",
    "http://127.0.0.1:4311 answered with HTTP 200.",
  ],
  [
    "The entry page loads without an HTTP or navigation error.",
    'The entry page returned HTTP 200 with title "Contact us".',
  ],
  ["The page renders visible content.", "The page rendered visible text."],
  ["No uncaught or application console error occurs.", "No uncaught or application console error."],
  ["Same-origin browser assets load successfully.", "Same-origin browser assets loaded."],
  ["No request returns a 5xx response.", "No response returned a 5xx status."],
  [
    "Captured same-origin browser content contains no detected secret.",
    "No credential-shaped value in 1 complete same-origin response (4105 bytes).",
  ],
  [
    "The page contacts no unexpected external origin.",
    "The page contacted only the declared Turnstile origin.",
  ],
];
---

<Base
  title="Sanitized attempt summary — Docs Trials"
  description="A visual summary of a sanitized Docs Trials Turnstile contact-form attempt."
>
  <article class="report-page shell">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to docs-trials</a>
    <header class="report-header">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Real local attempt · visual summary</p>
        <h1>Attempt Summary</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="outcome-stamp">
        <span>Baseline</span>
        <strong>Passed</strong>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="report-caveat">
      <strong>Task fulfillment was not verified.</strong>
      <p>
        This report records deterministic baseline observations. It is not a task-completion
        certificate.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="report-summary-note">
      <strong>Pre-release visual summary.</strong> Gate 2 is complete, but this page predates its successful
      release-candidate attempt set. It transcribes selected fields from a sanitized local report without
      publishing the retained evidence bundle. This page is not release-validation evidence, and readers
      cannot independently inspect its result references.
    </p>

    <dl class="report-meta">
      <div><dt>Trial</dt><dd>Turnstile contact form A</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Attempt</dt><dd><code>gate2-turnstile-a-20260826-175322-635</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Checks</dt><dd>9 passed · 0 failed · 0 inconclusive</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Agent</dt><dd>OpenCode · openai/gpt-5.6-sol</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Starter revision</dt><dd><code>1ebd1647e17e</code></dd></div>
      <div><dt>Manifest digest</dt><dd><code>8474d77f2835d7cd</code></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">01 / Task</p>
      <h2>What the subject agent was asked to build</h2>
      <p class="report-task">
        Using only the supplied documentation for Turnstile, replace the static starter page with a
        contact form protected by the published always-pass test keys. Validate submitted tokens
        server-side before accepting a contact submission. Keep the form at the entry URL.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">02 / Supplied documentation</p>
      <h2>Frozen trial copies and live attribution sources</h2>
      <ul class="document-list">
        <li>
          <span>01</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/client-side-rendering/"
            >Embed the Turnstile widget</a
          ><small
            >Live source (attribution only) · Trial copy frozen as Markdown · SHA-256 recorded</small
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>02</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/troubleshooting/testing/"
            >Turnstile testing keys</a
          ><small
            >Live source (attribution only) · Trial copy frozen as Markdown · SHA-256 recorded</small
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span>03</span><a
            href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile/get-started/server-side-validation/"
            >Server-side validation</a
          ><small
            >Live source (attribution only) · Trial copy frozen as Markdown · SHA-256 recorded</small
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">03 / Baseline checks</p>
      <h2 id="baseline-results-heading">These are the only results Docs Trials produced.</h2>
      <div
        class="result-table-wrap"
        role="region"
        tabindex="0"
        aria-labelledby="baseline-results-heading"
      >
        <table class="result-table">
          <caption>Baseline check results</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">No.</th>
              <th scope="col">Outcome</th>
              <th scope="col">Check</th>
              <th scope="col">Observed detail</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {
              results.map(([check, detail], index) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="result-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</td>
                  <td class="result-badge">Pass</td>
                  <th class="result-check" scope="row">
                    {check}
                  </th>
                  <td class="result-detail">{detail}</td>
                </tr>
              ))
            }
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="report-split report-section">
      <div>
        <p class="report-section-number">04 / Omitted</p>
        <h2>Build check</h2>
        <p>
          The manifest declared no build command. The check did not apply and received no outcome.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="report-section-number">05 / Ungraded</p>
        <h2>Source changes</h2>
        <p>
          Git-visible changes were retained as evidence. Git-ignored workspace paths were excluded.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="goals-section report-section">
      <p class="report-section-number">06 / Author goals</p>
      <h2>Recorded for context. Not verified.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The contact page displays a visible Turnstile test widget.</li>
        <li>The server rejects a submission without a valid Turnstile token.</li>
        <li>The published always-pass test key pair can complete a submission.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="goals-note">These statements did not change any baseline result.</p>
    </section>

    <aside class="report-reading">
      <h2>How to read this report</h2>
      <p><strong>Pass</strong> means Docs Trials observed the behavior named by that check.</p>
      <p><strong>Fail</strong> means the observation contradicted the check.</p>
      <p><strong>Inconclusive</strong> means there was not enough evidence to decide.</p>
      <p>
        The baseline does not prove that the application fulfills the task or that documentation
        caused an outcome.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </article>
</Base>
